OL,3,GStrathclyde
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FA few
OL,6,Fshowers across Argyll and the Central
OL,7,FBelt this evening and overnight, but
OL,8,Fdry in the south. Fresh southerly
OL,9,Fwinds along the coast, occasionally
OL,10,Fstrong across Tiree later.
OL,11,
OL,12,CSunday:FWidespread rain, occasionally
OL,13,Fheavy, will spread northeast during
OL,14,Fthe morning. Drier and clearer weather
OL,15,Fwill spread from the west in the
OL,16,Fafternoon. Windy in the morning.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
