OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:FDry
OL,6,Fwith some sunshine on Monday. Windy
OL,7,Fand mainly dry on Tuesday, but patchy
OL,8,Frain possible in the afternoon,
OL,9,Fturning heavy overnight. Bright with a
OL,10,Ffew showers on Wednesday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
